```Title: AWS IAM Access Key or Console Password Created (AWS CloudTrail)```
```ATT&CK: T1098.001 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 63d41250-2e8a-412f-8a55-fd74b65c261e```
```Data source: AWS CloudTrail (Splunk Add-on for AWS). Change index to where your CloudTrail data lives.```
```False positives: Administrators onboarding users or rotating keys; Automation that rotates access keys```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=aws sourcetype="aws:cloudtrail"
(eventSource="iam.amazonaws.com" eventName IN ("CreateAccessKey", "CreateLoginProfile", "UpdateLoginProfile"))
| table _time eventSource eventName userIdentity.arn sourceIPAddress awsRegion errorCode
